roboparty-imu (1.4.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Align the hipnuc driver protocol decoders with the upstream SDK: unified
    samples for serial and CAN, remove the obsolete parser compatibility
    layer.
  * Add the HiPNUC CAN OTA tool (scripts/hipnuc_ota.py): version query and
    firmware update with model gating, SHA-256 reporting, HiPNUC image
    validation, JSON output, power-cycle recovery and a single-master bus
    check.
  * Add the IMU calibration guard (scripts/imu_calib_guard.py): back up and
    restore ACCMIS/ACCB/GYRMIS/GYRB matrices around firmware updates.
  * Install the OTA Python modules to site-packages and /opt/roboparty/bin;
    add python3-can and python3-serial runtime dependencies.
  * Add the HIPNUC 1.7.2 firmware image, update DBC files and rename
    bundled firmware files.

 -- RoboParty <cenliey@qq.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 14:11:03 +0800

